    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708250/extras/cded50009e230e8d156bc23955dbd7b1.poster.avif?t=1755268077\" width=600 height=82 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708250/extras/cded50009e230e8d156bc23955dbd7b1.webm?t=1755268077\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708250/extras/cded50009e230e8d156bc23955dbd7b1.mp4?t=1755268077\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Heaven's Dale needs you...</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Help your community grow happily by completing dozens of unique missions that always reward you with new content! At your own pace!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708250/extras/d767d2dee8f0c58c39f0378650b9502d.avif?t=1755268077\" width=600 height=104 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>So much to do...</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>My Heaven's Dale</i></strong> offers simple gameplay, daily-changing songs, plenty of activities, 3 achievement rooms to complete and a main story to follow!\u00a0A non-stressful experience, perfect for disconnecting while you enjoy many hours of content!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708250/extras/68ad7457e9a9e1fb85b85d66fd07e254.poster.webp?t=1755268077\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708250/extras/68ad7457e9a9e1fb85b85d66fd07e254.webp?t=1755268077\" class=\"bb_img\" width=1280 height=720 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708250/extras/54855d03fe1a5105d72a4b80ac043d16.poster.webp?t=1755268077\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708250/extras/54855d03fe1a5105d72a4b80ac043d16.webp?t=1755268077\" class=\"bb_img\" width=1280 height=720 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>There's something about that place...\u00a0</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You don't have to stay on planet Earth! Take a space trip and build your home up there, it's safe!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708250/extras/84dff4c0615a76812dd76ff62585f5d0.poster.webp?t=1755268077\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708250/extras/84dff4c0615a76812dd76ff62585f5d0.webp?t=1755268077\" class=\"bb_img\" width=1280 height=720 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Learn more about:</i></strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow crops right next to your home or build a Giant Greenhouse.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use barrels to increase the value of your crops.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy Chickens, Cows, Pigs, Goats, and Ducks for your Ranch.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level up as you complete activities!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy 7+ unique Pets to live with you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build relationships with over 30 unique characters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fish over 90+ types of fish while picking your next song.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore caves with multiple floors and different kinds of gems to collect.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn recipes and complete your Achievement Room.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from 12 girls or boys to marry and have a child with.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel to the Moon, build a house, and meet new creatures.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy new days with different music tracks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join festivals that bring the whole community together.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover secrets hidden all across Heaven's Dale.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708250/extras/13736374df2d747303a150a1f73ab8bb.avif?t=1755268077\" width=630 height=186 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708250/extras/cded50009e230e8d156bc23955dbd7b1.poster.avif?t=1755268077\" width=600 height=82 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708250/extras/cded50009e230e8d156bc23955dbd7b1.webm?t=1755268077\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708250/extras/cded50009e230e8d156bc23955dbd7b1.mp4?t=1755268077\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Heaven's Dale needs you...</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Help your community grow happily by completing dozens of unique missions that always reward you with new content! At your own pace!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708250/extras/d767d2dee8f0c58c39f0378650b9502d.avif?t=1755268077\" width=600 height=104 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>So much to do...</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>My Heaven's Dale</i></strong> offers simple gameplay, daily-changing songs, plenty of activities, 3 achievement rooms to complete and a main story to follow!\u00a0A non-stressful experience, perfect for disconnecting while you enjoy many hours of content!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708250/extras/68ad7457e9a9e1fb85b85d66fd07e254.poster.webp?t=1755268077\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708250/extras/68ad7457e9a9e1fb85b85d66fd07e254.webp?t=1755268077\" class=\"bb_img\" width=1280 height=720 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708250/extras/54855d03fe1a5105d72a4b80ac043d16.poster.webp?t=1755268077\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708250/extras/54855d03fe1a5105d72a4b80ac043d16.webp?t=1755268077\" class=\"bb_img\" width=1280 height=720 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>There's something about that place...\u00a0</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You don't have to stay on planet Earth! Take a space trip and build your home up there, it's safe!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708250/extras/84dff4c0615a76812dd76ff62585f5d0.poster.webp?t=1755268077\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708250/extras/84dff4c0615a76812dd76ff62585f5d0.webp?t=1755268077\" class=\"bb_img\" width=1280 height=720 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Learn more about:</i></strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow crops right next to your home or build a Giant Greenhouse.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use barrels to increase the value of your crops.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy Chickens, Cows, Pigs, Goats, and Ducks for your Ranch.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level up as you complete activities!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy 7+ unique Pets to live with you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build relationships with over 30 unique characters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fish over 90+ types of fish while picking your next song.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore caves with multiple floors and different kinds of gems to collect.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn recipes and complete your Achievement Room.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from 12 girls or boys to marry and have a child with.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel to the Moon, build a house, and meet new creatures.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy new days with different music tracks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join festivals that bring the whole community together.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover secrets hidden all across Heaven's Dale.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708250/extras/13736374df2d747303a150a1f73ab8bb.avif?t=1755268077\" width=630 height=186 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "Welcome to My Heaven's Dale! Live as a farmer, lumberjack, miner, or fisherman. Help the community fulfill their wishes, explore the entire island and even the Moon! Collect countless items, fish, and gems to complete your collection rooms in this stress-free casual experience.",
